---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ContactForm from '../components/ContactForm.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const proof = [
  { k: 'IESE Business School', v: 'Research and teaching since 2015' },
  { k: 'Kuma Partners', v: 'Lead Partner' },
  { k: 'Engineer by training', v: 'Doctorate' },
  { k: 'EN / ES / DE / FR', v: 'Four working languages' },
];

const pillars = [
  {
    n: '01',
    title: 'Ethical clarity over easy answers',
    body: 'The hardest calls at the top are rarely technical. We name the trade-off you are actually making, who carries its cost, and what you are prepared to defend in a year. Then you decide.',
  },
  {
    n: '02',
    title: 'Systems architecture over symptom management',
    body: 'Friction between two executives is usually a design problem: unclear decision rights, a governance model that stopped fitting at 40 people, incentives that pull against each other. We fix the structure so the same fight does not return next quarter.',
  },
  {
    n: '03',
    title: 'Cognitive precision',
    body: 'Founders often think in jumps, patterns and bursts of intensity. That wiring built the company and can stall it. I work with how your mind actually operates, drawing on neuroscience and on research with non-linear leaders.',
  },
];

const modes = [
  {
    tag: '1:1',
    title: 'Executive advisory',
    body: 'Bespoke counsel for scaling CEOs and founders. A standing thinking partner for the decisions you cannot take to your board, your co-founder or your team yet.',
    href: '/advisory',
    cta: 'How it works',
    external: false,
  },
  {
    tag: 'Peer',
    title: 'The Round',
    body: 'A confidential, year-round peer board for founders and CEOs. A monthly session with peers who will challenge you, individual sparring with me, an immersion and an annual offsite.',
    href: site.links.round,
    cta: 'theround.kuma.partners',
    external: true,
  },
  {
    tag: 'Team',
    title: 'Kuma Partners',
    body: 'When the issue sits in the leadership team itself. Diagnostics, executive alignment sprints and strategic offsites, delivered with former CEOs and operators.',
    href: site.links.kuma,
    cta: 'kuma.partners',
    external: true,
  },
];
---
<Base>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="container-x pt-16 md:pt-28 pb-20 md:pb-28">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-end">
      <div class="md:col-span-9">
        <p class="eyebrow">Strategic advisor · Founders and C-suite</p>
        <h1 class="mt-6 font-serif text-[2.6rem] leading-[1.04] sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[5.5rem] tracking-[-0.02em] text-balance">
          Translating deep systemic insight into <em class="text-bronze">decisive</em> leadership.
        </h1>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-3 md:pb-3">
        <p class="text-graphite leading-relaxed">I work with founders and executives at the point where growth stops being linear and the old way of deciding starts to cost you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 sm:items-center">
      <a href="#contact" class="bg-ink text-paper px-7 py-4 text-sm tracking-wide hover:bg-bronze transition-colors text-center">Request a strategic diagnostic</a>
      <a href={site.links.kuma} rel="noopener" class="px-1 py-4 text-sm text-graphite hover:text-bronze transition-colors underline underline-offset-4 decoration-line">Leadership teams: Kuma Partners ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Proof bar -->
  <section aria-label="Credentials" class="border-y border-line bg-bone/50">
    <ul class="container-x grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4">
      {proof.map((p, i) => (
        <li class:list={['py-6 md:py-8 pr-4', i % 2 === 1 && 'pl-4 border-l border-line', i > 1 && 'border-t md:border-t-0 border-line', i === 2 && 'md:pl-4 md:border-l']}>
          <p class="font-serif text-lg md:text-xl leading-tight">{p.k}</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-stone">{p.v}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- Philosophy -->
  <section class="container-x py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10">
      <div class="md:col-span-4">
        <p class="eyebrow">Philosophy</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl leading-tight">Slow down to speed up.</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-graphite leading-relaxed">Speed is rarely the constraint in a scale-up. Decision latency is: the days lost between knowing something needs to change and someone acting on it.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6 divide-y divide-line border-y border-line">
        {pillars.map((p) => (
          <li class="py-8 grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-4">
            <span class="font-serif text-bronze text-lg">{p.n}</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight">{p.title}</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-graphite leading-relaxed">{p.body}</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Modes -->
  <section class="bg-ink text-paper">
    <div class="container-x py-24 md:py-32">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <p class="eyebrow !text-paper/50">Ways to work together</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl leading-tight">Different tensions call for different rooms.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-16 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-px bg-paper/15 border border-paper/15">
        {modes.map((m) => (
          <article class="bg-ink p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col">
            <p class="eyebrow !text-bronze-soft">{m.tag}</p>
            <h3 class="mt-6 font-serif text-3xl">{m.title}</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-paper/70 leading-relaxed flex-1">{m.body}</p>
            <a href={m.href} rel={m.external ? 'noopener' : undefined} class="mt-10 text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-paper hover:text-bronze-soft transition-colors">
              {m.cta} <span aria-hidden="true">{m.external ? '↗' : '→'}</span>
            </a>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Research -->
  <section id="research" class="container-x py-24 md:py-32 scroll-mt-16">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start">
      <div class="md:col-span-5">
        <div class="aspect-[3/4] max-w-sm bg-ink text-paper p-8 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-[0_30px_60px_-30px_rgba(28,29,31,0.5)]">
          <p class="eyebrow !text-bronze-soft">Forthcoming</p>
          <div>
            <p class="font-serif text-4xl leading-[1.05]">The Non-Linear Operating System</p>
            <div class="mt-6 h-px w-16 bg-bronze-soft"></div>
            <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-paper/60">Sven Mulfinger</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7">
        <p class="eyebrow">Research</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl leading-tight">How non-linear minds build, and how they stall.</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-graphite leading-relaxed">
          <p>Many of the founders I work with have spiky cognitive profiles: ADHD, giftedness, dyslexia, autism or a mix that never got a label. The traits that let them see around corners also shape how they delegate, decide and handle conflict once the company grows.</p>
          <p>The Non-Linear Operating System is a book in development with Prof. Tomas Kluetter at IESE Business School. It draws on more than 20 case studies of founders and senior executives and turns them into practical operating models for leaders and the teams around them.</p>
          <p>My work with IESE goes back to a 2015 case study co-authored with Prof. Iñigo Gallo.</p>
        </div>
        <a href={site.links.neurodisruptors} rel="noopener" class="mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm border-b border-ink pb-1 hover:text-bronze hover:border-bronze transition-colors">Explore the research at neurodisruptors.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact -->
  <section id="contact" class="bg-bone border-t border-line scroll-mt-16">
    <div class="container-x py-24 md:py-32 grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
      <div class="md:col-span-4">
        <p class="eyebrow">Strategic diagnostic</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl leading-tight">Start with one honest conversation.</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-graphite leading-relaxed">Tell me what is on your desk. If there is a fit, we set up a diagnostic conversation. If there is not, I will say so and, where I can, point you to someone better placed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6">
        <ContactForm />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
